{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"二、夏，逆婦姜于齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"其謂之逆婦姜于齊何？略之也。高子曰：「娶乎大夫者，略之也。」","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"三、狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"四、秋，楚人滅江。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"五、晉侯伐秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"六、衞侯使寗速來聘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_100_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_100","textTraditional":"七、冬十有一月壬寅，夫人風氏薨。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}